    <!--
      Bangla translations of the app chrome.

      Note: this file translates the *interface*, not the lessons. The
      English/Bangla/Arabic lessons each carry their own script in
      `data/content/*Catalog.kt`, because a lesson's example word must stay in its
      own language for the pronunciation to be correct.

      Bangla has two plural categories (one / other), unlike English's
      one/other split, so the `one` variants here are the translations a Bangla
      speaker would actually use.
    -->

